# Canopy-destination secrets overlay [OPS.37 / INF.16]. Kamal (2.12) reads
# `secrets-common` + `secrets.<destination>` for a `-d canopy` run, and the
# destination file WINS on key collision — that is the whole mechanism here.
#
# WHY this file exists: Redis isolation for canopy lived ONLY in the CI job
# (deploy.yml maps secrets.CANOPY_REDIS_URL into $REDIS_URL), so a LOCAL
# `kamal deploy -d canopy` — the very command DEPLOY-DAY Phase 3 names — would
# read secrets-common's REDIS_URL=$REDIS_URL from the operator's shell and put
# staging on the PRODUCTION Redis. This overlay makes both legs read the same
# canopy value structurally.
#
# ⚠️ Fallback is a LOUD placeholder on purpose, never $REDIS_URL: a silent
# fall-through to the production URL is exactly the defect this file removes.
# With CANOPY_REDIS_URL unset the container gets an invalid URL → Redis client
# fails loudly and /ready 503s, instead of quietly sharing production state.
# Local run:  export CANOPY_REDIS_URL=rediss://… ; kamal deploy -d canopy
REDIS_URL=${CANOPY_REDIS_URL:-CANOPY_REDIS_URL_NOT_SET}

# [INF.27 move (2), 2026-09-02] TESTNET RPC remaps — same shape as REDIS_URL above, and the
# same reason: the base names resolve to the PRODUCTION (mainnet) secrets in secrets-common,
# so a destination run without these four lines would hand staging mainnet endpoints. The
# boot guard would refuse that (`WEB3_CHAIN_ENV: testnet` in config/deploy.canopy.yml), but a
# refusal is a DETECTOR, not an isolation — this overlay is the isolation, and the refusal is
# what stands behind it. Fallback is a LOUD placeholder on purpose: an unset CANOPY_* twin
# gives the guard a non-testnet "URL" (no chain marker) and it refuses, never a silent
# mainnet call. All four are judged by `scripts/deploy_secret_scan.rb` invariant B4.
# Local run:  export CANOPY_ALCHEMY_POLYGON_RPC_URL=… (and the other three) ; kamal deploy -d canopy
ALCHEMY_POLYGON_RPC_URL=${CANOPY_ALCHEMY_POLYGON_RPC_URL:-CANOPY_ALCHEMY_POLYGON_RPC_URL_NOT_SET}
ALCHEMY_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=${CANOPY_ALCHEMY_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL:-CANOPY_ALCHEMY_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL_NOT_SET}
SOLANA_RPC_URL=${CANOPY_SOLANA_RPC_URL:-CANOPY_SOLANA_RPC_URL_NOT_SET}
CELO_RPC_URL=${CANOPY_CELO_RPC_URL:-CANOPY_CELO_RPC_URL_NOT_SET}
